{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日前寝る前に羊を久しぶりに数えて160匹ぐらいの羊と出会いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 4期生　岩手県出身"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤璃果です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ5BXDASPG6FH21NDRYHK78","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達がくれたビションフリーゼちゃんが、可愛くて愛しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏面は鏡になっています✧︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ5BYDRY1RJ856ZKEAX8WPT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n夏って感じがしますね、\n "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ5BZJRJEC23BXWS8D9ZSBQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nお団子自分でするのは難しいから嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ5C0KXC0YCCJ4FDDE1JNGQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月7日発売だった週刊少年マガジンさんのオフショットでした！遅くなってすみません(ᯅ̈ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は17:05～17:55 NHK盛岡放送局さん ｢おつまみラジオです｣\nとても緊張します( 'Θ' )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いてくださると嬉しいです❁︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1週間前は新内眞衣さんと乃木坂46のオールナイトニッポンに出演させて頂けて、本当に嬉しかったですし、新内さんとお話が出来て嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る時間が分からなくなって5時半まで頭がはてなでいっぱいでした(？？？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ5C1PGTXHJ9ZGGH0A9TG9D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nリゾート気分味わえたよ\n行った時は大雨でしたが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山感想をコメントに書いてくださったり嬉しいです！ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月になって新しいドラマがたくさん始まって嬉しい気持ちになったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい環境で慣れないことが沢山あった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい出会いがあったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月は新しさが沢山の毎日ですが、\nその新しさを楽しんでいけたら良いですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無理しないでくださいね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにとって素敵な一日になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#75 りか"}],"source":"archive"}